 result←object Get arg
 result←object._pic ##.##.∆WG'CBits' ⍝ The Bitmap child will always exist
 :If ×≢arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Get'##.##.Error~##.##.IsNum arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: Get'##.##.Error 1≠≢⍴arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: Get'##.##.Error 4≠≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Get'##.##.Error∨/arg<0
     arg←⌊0.5+arg×4⍴⊃##._supp.MyUnits object ⍝ Convert scaled arg to whole pixels
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: Get'##.##.Error∨/result⍴⍛<+⌿2 2⍴arg
     result←arg[3 4]↑arg[1 2]↓result
 :EndIf
 result←256⊥⊖(3⍴256)⊤result
